<meta charset='utf-8'>
<title>Irosin Disaster Safety System - Firestore Database Schema</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Calibri', 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #1e293b;
